## Example Use Cases

### Use Case 1: Simple Backtesting
User selects a prophet → Client downloads everything → Runs inference on historical data → Plots actual vs. predicted → Shows RMSE, directional accuracy

### Use Case 2: Live Forecasting
User provides last 30 days of prices → Prophet runs inference → Shows next day's predicted price → User can adjust input transform logic → Re-run instantly

### Use Case 3: Prophet Comparison
User selects multiple prophets → Run all in parallel (browser-side) → Compare predictions side-by-side → Pick best performer

### Use Case 4: Custom Transforms
User edits `output_transform.js` in browser → Adds custom logic (e.g., smoothing) → Re-run inference → See updated predictions immediately
